    "title": "Olmsted County Approves $39M Fairgrounds Project - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Rochester\nOlmsted County Approves $39M Fairgrounds Project\nBy Andy Brownell,\n10 hours agoRochester, MN (KROC-AM News) - A groundbreaking ceremony is expected to take place in the near future for a nearly $40 million project at Graham Park in Rochester. The Olmsted County Board of Commissioners voted unanimously Tuesday night to approve three contracts for the construction of a long-planned exhibition center at Graham Park, which is also known by many as the Olmsted County Fairgrounds. The three contracts cover the construction of the building, mechanical work, and electrical work for the new facility and total just over $39 million.",
